<title>USA: U.S. completes Albania evacuation.</title>
<headline>U.S. completes Albania evacuation.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States has completed its evacuation of nearly 900 Americans and citizens of other countries from Albania, the Defence Department said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said a contingent of about 100 U.S. Marines would remain in Tirana to provide security for the U.S. embassy and housing compound and two ships remained nearby in support.</p>
<p>A third vessel, the helicopter landing ship Nassau with 1,400 Marines, left the Albania evacuation operation late last week and was heading for Africa in case an evacuation of Americans from Zaire was required.</p>
